A stakeholder asks for a one-off analysis of why support-ticket volume rose last quarter. There is no labelled outcome column. What does the function below return for this ask?

```python
def triage(ask: dict) -> str:
    if ask.get("simple_rule_suffices"):
        return "Not a project -- write the rule, ship it in a day"
    if not ask.get("historical_labelled_data_exists"):
        return "Not ready -- this is a data collection project first"
    if ask.get("one_off_analysis_only"):
        return "Not a lifecycle project -- this is an analytics/EDA task"
    if ask.get("requires_deployed_prediction_system"):
        return "Full lifecycle project -- use the charter template"
    return "Unclear -- run a 1-day spike using EDA"
```

```python
ask = {
    "simple_rule_suffices": False,
    "historical_labelled_data_exists": False,
    "one_off_analysis_only": True,
    "requires_deployed_prediction_system": False,
}
print(triage(ask))
```
